flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B{Select Role}

    %% Library User Login
    B -->|Library User| C[Library User Login Menu]

    C -->|Create Account| D[Enter Username, Email, Password, Payment Info]
    D --> E{Information Valid?}
    E -->|No| F[Display Validation Error]
    F --> C
    E -->|Yes| G[Create and Save Account]
    G --> C

    C -->|Log In| H[Enter Email and Password]
    H --> I{Credentials Correct?}

    I -->|No| J[Display Error Message]
    J --> C

    I -->|Yes| K[User Logged In]

    C -->|Forgot Login Credentials| L[Display 'Please Contact Your Admin']
    L --> C

    %% User Menu
    K --> M[Display User Menu]

    M --> N[View Account Information]
    M --> O[View Membership Fees]
    M --> P[Search Books]
    M --> Q[Request Books]

    %% Account Information
    N --> R[Display User ID, Name, Username, Email, Payment Info]
    R --> S{Edit Information?}

    S -->|No| M
    S -->|Yes| T[Update Details]

    T --> U{Changing Password?}
    U -->|No| V[Save Changes]
    U -->|Yes| W[Enter Current Password]
    W --> V

    V --> M

    %% Librarian Login
    B -->|Librarian| X[Librarian Login Menu]

    X -->|Log In| Y[Enter Librarian ID and Password]
    Y --> Z{Credentials Correct?}

    Z -->|Yes| AA[Librarian Logged In]
    Z -->|No| AB[Display Error Message]
    AB --> X

    X -->|Forgot Account Information| AC[Display 'Please Contact Your Admin']
    AC --> X

    AA --> AD[Access Librarian Features]

    AD --> AE([End])